  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fair Recovery &#x2013; Strengthened Civil Society and Media for Fiscal Justice in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on Tax revenue and public budgets are expanded and made significantly more progressive and gender sensitive in Kenya through building  the capacity of civil society and investigative journalists, supporting progressive and gender sensitive Domestic Resource Mobilization and to increase pro -poor and gender sensitive budgets and address the debt crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
